```

## Gotchas

### 0.19 → 0.20

- **`AssetId::invalid()` and `AssetId::INVALID_UUID` are deprecated.** Store `Option<AssetId<T>>` and use `None`. `AssetId::default()` is *not* a null value; a real asset can own it.
